    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "** UNFURNISHED**\n\nThis well-presented 3-bedroom terraced house is situated in the popular village of Riverstick, offering comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation in a convenient residential location.\n\nThe property is within walking distance of the 226/228 bus stop, providing excellent transport links to Kinsale, Cork City and Cork Airport, making it an ideal location for commuters.\n\nAccommodation comprises:\nEntrance hallway\nBright and spacious sitting room with stove\nFully fitted kitchen/dining area\nSeparate utility area\nDownstairs WC\nMaster bedroom with ensuite\nTwo further bedrooms\nMain family bathroom\nEnclosed private rear garden\nOn-street parking\nOil heating\n\nThe master bedroom benefits from a private ensuite, while the two additional bedrooms offer flexibility for family living, a home office or guest accommodation. The enclosed rear garden provides a pleasant private outdoor space, with on-street parking available for added convenience.\n\nRiverstick offers a peaceful residential setting while remaining within easy reach of Kinsale, Cork City and Cork Airport.\n\nAvailable from: 1st September 2026\n\nApplications\n\nApplications are invited by EMAIL ONLY.\n\nWhen making an enquiry, please provide:\n\nName\nEmail address\nTelephone number\nNumber of people who will be residing at the property\nAny other relevant information that may support your application\n\nReferences will be required.\n\nStrictly no pets.\nStrictly no smoking.\n\nPlease note that only applicants who provide the requested information by email will be considered for a viewing."
      },
